☐ FluentasAI SignFlow - Digital Signatures
Purpose: Receive one-time passcodes (OTP) to authenticate and complete digital document signatures via FluentasAI SignFlow.

Message Frequency: Event-based only. You will receive SMS messages only when:

A document requires your digital signature
