Understanding Event-Based Messaging
What does "event-based" mean?

Event-based messaging means you will ONLY receive SMS messages when a specific action or event occurs that requires your attention. We do NOT send:

Regular scheduled messages
Marketing or promotional content
Bulk announcements (unless you opt-in to General Communications)
You are in control: Messages are triggered only by actions relevant to your work, such as receiving a secure document or being asked to sign a document.

