Frequently Asked Questions
Q: What if I only want to receive messages for document signatures but not document access?
A: You can selectively opt-in to only FluentasAI SignFlow. Simply check only that box on the consent form.

Q: Will I receive marketing messages?
A: No. These are transactional, event-based messages only related to your work activities.

Q: What if I change my phone number?
A: Contact HR immediately at HR@microhealthllc.com to update your information and submit a new consent form.

Q: Can I temporarily pause messages?
A: Yes. Contact support at (855) 294-3547 to discuss temporary suspension options.

Q: What if I accidentally opt-out?
A: You can opt back in by submitting a new consent form to HR or contacting support.

Q: Are these messages secure?
A: Yes. All messages are transmitted via encrypted channels and comply with security best practices.

